{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fools, Maniacs and Liars is a suspenseful narrative game set in China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/a9338a50c8c1b8cc7923a931a8a66dcc.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in the fictional ceramic county in southern Fujian\u2014Wushan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since ancient times, a giant Buddha known as &quot;Mida&quot; has stood upon Mount Wushan. Countless folk tales surround the statue\u2014some even say Mida is alive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Then, one day in 2009, the Buddha vanished into thin air. And a half-century enigma was about to come to light.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/8c19e9bab136cea2ce6fe025f0d1d798.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a realist tale shot through with magical realism and absurdity\u2014a story born of a tumultuous age.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woven from layers of suspense and dark humor, the chronicle of the Wushan Great Buddha's demise begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story twists and turns through constant peril and escalating mysteries, where nothing is certain until the final revelation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/fa93aa7e66d5486bd6dcad9a64390937.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cinematic visuals and carefully crafted sound design, you'll experience a feast of Chinese aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic-panel framing is woven throughout the game, lending a distinctive atmosphere and a smooth gameplay cadence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/539591ec290dd17fdd67a665b4f38f1e.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the roles of six distinct characters\u2014one after another\u2014returning to the month before the Mida's disappearance to uncover the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six characters, each with a markedly different personality, background, and way of getting by. Under the compassionate gaze of Mida, their fates seem preordained, yet still brim with possibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Light Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/beea6cd626bf2a2a8735865b3aad1b24.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to experiment. Our puzzles are designed to be readable and fair, not punishing. We respect your time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven experience complemented by light puzzle interactions. Every design choice exists to serve immersion.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1741170?t=1770865973","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770865973","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/9ec31d74555308db92ed026214886684cf705338/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770865973","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/9ec31d74555308db92ed026214886684cf705338/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770865973","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3227590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fools, Maniacs and Liars is a suspenseful narrative game set in China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/a9338a50c8c1b8cc7923a931a8a66dcc.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in the fictional ceramic county in southern Fujian\u2014Wushan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since ancient times, a giant Buddha known as &quot;Mida&quot; has stood upon Mount Wushan. Countless folk tales surround the statue\u2014some even say Mida is alive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Then, one day in 2009, the Buddha vanished into thin air. And a half-century enigma was about to come to light.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/8c19e9bab136cea2ce6fe025f0d1d798.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a realist tale shot through with magical realism and absurdity\u2014a story born of a tumultuous age.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woven from layers of suspense and dark humor, the chronicle of the Wushan Great Buddha's demise begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story twists and turns through constant peril and escalating mysteries, where nothing is certain until the final revelation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/fa93aa7e66d5486bd6dcad9a64390937.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cinematic visuals and carefully crafted sound design, you'll experience a feast of Chinese aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic-panel framing is woven throughout the game, lending a distinctive atmosphere and a smooth gameplay cadence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/539591ec290dd17fdd67a665b4f38f1e.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the roles of six distinct characters\u2014one after another\u2014returning to the month before the Mida's disappearance to uncover the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six characters, each with a markedly different personality, background, and way of getting by. Under the compassionate gaze of Mida, their fates seem preordained, yet still brim with possibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Light Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/extras/beea6cd626bf2a2a8735865b3aad1b24.avif?t=1770865973\" width=625 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to experiment. Our puzzles are designed to be readable and fair, not punishing. We respect your time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven experience complemented by light puzzle interactions. Every design choice exists to serve immersion.</p></li></ul>","developers":["NanZhai Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741170/header.jpg?t=1770865973","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1741170/1193258101/24c1498464be35e8646859d1e3c66a5b8f549147/1752114326/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752577828","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1741170/1193258101/24c1498464be35e8646859d1e3c66a5b8f549147/1752114326/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752577828","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1741170/1193258101/24c1498464be35e8646859d1e3c66a5b8f549147/1752114326/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752577828","id":257167136,"name":"demoPV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167136/5b7e39fe4f9da6828e5c3c5ab4e52b6c39dafcc7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752577828"}],"name":"Fools, Maniacs and Liars","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},