riven game of suspense, crime, and dark humor. Amid exquisitely crafted art and a gripping story, the Wushan Great Buddha's demise unfolds.","steam_appid":1741170,"support_info":{"email":"NanZhaiGame@outlook.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}